    "finance.guide_step1_desc": "Lock your BOQ estimate → budget lines are created automatically from sections. Or add them manually per WBS category.",
    "finance.guide_step1_title": "Create budget lines",
    "finance.guide_step2_desc": "Create payable invoices (from subcontractors) or receivable invoices (to clients). Attach line items and link to WBS.",
