    "about.platform_desc": "OpenConstructionERP covers the full construction estimation workflow - BOQ editing, 4D scheduling, 5D cost modeling, AI-powered estimation, CAD/BIM quantity takeoff (RVT, IFC, DWG, DGN), tendering, and reporting. Supports regional classification standards and custom schemas.",
